---
import deck from '../data/investor-deck.json';
const size=(deck.bytes/1e6).toFixed(1);
const reviewed=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB',{day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'}).format(new Date(deck.reviewedAt+'T12:00:00Z'));
---
<section id="investor-presentation" class="inv-section inv-deck" aria-labelledby="investor-deck-title">
  <div>
    <p class="inv-eyebrow">THE INVESTMENT PRESENTATION</p>
    <h2 id="investor-deck-title">The SmartTec case.<br/>Ready for a closer look.</h2>
    <p>The proposed 64-B300 deployment, founder funding, site agreement and lower-cost cooling options in one presentation. Current evidence and unfinished costs are separated from historical financial comparisons.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="inv-deck-download">
    <p class="inv-deck-format">PDF <span>{deck.pages} pages / {size} MB</span></p>
    <a class="inv-button" href="/api/investor/presentation" download={deck.filename}>Download investor presentation</a>
    <p class="inv-note">{reviewed} edition. Complete funding and updated returns remain open pending customer terms, installed quotes, operating costs and usable power.</p>
    <a href="#owner-deployment">Explore the editable financial scenarios</a>
    <a class="inv-deck-contact" href="mailto:yasir@smarttec.dev?subject=SmartTec%20investment%20diligence">Arrange an investment discussion <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <figure class="inv-deck-hero">
    <img src="/assets/investor/b300-studio.webp" alt="Runway studio concept based on NVIDIA's DGX B300 product reference with SmartTec signage" width="2752" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <div class="inv-deck-image-copy" aria-hidden="true">AI infrastructure,<br/>built in phases.</div>
    <figcaption><span>01 / GPU COMPUTE</span> Runway-generated concept using NVIDIA's DGX B300 visual reference. Management identifies Supermicro for the proposed systems; this artwork is not the selected configuration.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="inv-deck-gallery">
    <figure>
      <img src="/assets/investor/power-supply-concept.webp" alt="Concept arrangement of solar panels, battery cabinets and a gas generator near a compute building" width="2752" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <figcaption><span>02 / ENERGY STRATEGY</span> Solar, storage and gas supply concept. Capacity, cost scope and commissioning require verification.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img src="/assets/investor/campus-dusk.webp" alt="Runway architectural concept of a low-rise SmartTec campus at dusk" width="2752" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <figcaption><span>03 / CAMPUS VISION</span> Architectural concept with SmartTec branding. This image does not depict existing buildings or approved development plans.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="inv-note">These AI-generated visuals illustrate the strategy. They do not show installed SmartTec equipment, an operating campus or approved engineering plans.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .inv-deck{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:4rem;background:linear-gradient(125deg,#071d16ed,#163e31eb 55%,#285847e8),url('/assets/investor/fiber-gradient.webp') center/cover;border-top:1px solid #ffffff25;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff25}
  .inv-deck h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,4.2rem)}
  .inv-deck-download{align-self:center;min-width:0}
  .inv-deck-format{font:3rem var(--f-sans);margin:0 0 1.5rem;color:#7be88a}
  .inv-deck-format span{font:13px var(--f-mono);display:block;margin-top:.5rem;color:#eef1ef}
  .inv-deck .inv-button{text-align:center;white-space:normal}
  .inv-deck-contact{display:block;margin-top:1rem;color:#7be88a}
  .inv-deck figure{margin:0;min-width:0}
  .inv-deck-hero,.inv-deck-gallery{grid-column:1/-1}
  .inv-deck-hero{position:relative}
  .inv-deck-image-copy{position:absolute;top:22%;left:4%;font:500 clamp(1.2rem,3.4vw,3.6rem)/1.12 var(--f-sans);letter-spacing:-.035em;color:#eef1ef;max-width:49%;text-shadow:0 2px 22px #071d16}
  .inv-deck img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:2752/1536;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid #ffffff25}
  .inv-deck figcaption{font:14px/1.6 var(--f-sans);color:#bcd0c5;padding-top:1rem}
  .inv-deck figcaption span{display:block;font:11px/1.5 var(--f-mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:#7be88a;margin-bottom:.5rem}
  .inv-deck-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem}
  .inv-deck-gallery>.inv-note{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0}
  @media(max-width:760px){.inv-deck{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.inv-deck-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
